    timezone: 'CDT',
    description:
      'For over 22 years, the Flatland Film Festival has celebrated the art of cinema with a vibrant mix of storytelling. Though primarily a short film festival, Flatland also showcases an eclectic lineup of feature films, documentaries, animations, music videos, and video art. Its programming is designed to stir emotion, challenge perspectives, and highlight the transformative power of visual storytelling—enriching the cultural conversation in Lubbock and beyond. The 2025 festival invites short film submissions from all genres and is especially excited to accept feature film entries that spotlight stories from Texas and the Southwest. One standout feature will be selected to premiere at the festival. Visit the official website for submission guidelines and deadlines!',
