    description:
      'The Red Clay Strays are coming to The Outdoor Stage at Cook’s Garage for their Get Right Tour! This outdoor concert will take place rain or shine, so be prepared for any weather as the show must go on. Please note that all ticket sales are final with no refunds, and only clear bags are allowed inside the venue for security reasons. Once you enter, re-entry is not permitted, so plan to enjoy the entire performance. For everyone’s safety, weapons—including pocket knives—are prohibited. Feel free to bring your own lawn chairs for comfortable seating under the stars, but they must be removed from bags during security checks (lawn chairs are not allowed in some premium seating areas). Outside food and beverages are not permitted, but a variety of refreshments will be available for purchase on site. Professional photography equipment requires prior approval, and pets are not allowed. Keep an eye on the official event page for updates, parking information, and any changes to the supporting acts.',
